# Water: gas-phase XTB2 geometry optimization
# Purpose:
#   Cheap semiempirical (XTB2) gas-phase Opt of a single water molecule, for
#   comparison with the r2SCAN-3c gas-phase result and/or as a quick reference
#   alongside the Apixaban gas-phase XTB2 Opt
#   (Apixaban/Gas/XTB2/ApixabanGasXTB2Opt.inp).
#
# Starting geometry: simple standard water geometry (same starting guess used
#   for Calculations/water/water.inp, the earlier B3LYP/def2-SVP water Opt).

! XTB2 Opt

* xyz 0 1
O   0.0   0.0   0.1
H   0.0   0.7  -0.4
H   0.0  -0.7  -0.4
*
